  "brain_first": "“先圈定位词，不要重新从第一段读全文。”",
  "sort_order": 1015,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 636
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "According to paragraph..., What did..., When/",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 637
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Where/Which...；答案通常能在局部直接找到。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 638
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 639
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“细节题”就是答案有明确文本证据。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 640
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先圈定位词，不要重新从第一段读全文。”",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 641
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 高考阅读大量题目都能通过精准定位解决，基础学生最应该先拿稳。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 642
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 643
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 读题干，圈人物、时间、地点、数字、专有名词、段落号。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 644
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 回文章扫这些词或同义表达。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 645
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 找到定位区后读前一句+当前句+后一句。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 646
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 把四个选项逐项与原文事实对照。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 647
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 648
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 649
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 650
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题干给 paragraph 2 → 先只看第二段",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 651
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有专有名词/年份 → 优先用它定位",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 652
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 无明显定位词 → 用题目核心名词和动词",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 653
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 一个选项与明确证据同义，其他选项能被排除。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 654
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 四个都像时，不凭“合理”，回原文逐项验证主语、时间、数量、程度。",
      "sourcePage": 24,
      "sourceIndex": 655
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 656
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The workshop opens at 9:30, but visitors are asked to arrive 15 minutes early.",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 657
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若问 recommended arrival time：9:15，不是9:30。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 658
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 659
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 原文有同一个词就选。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 660
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 定位到了却只读半句，忽略后面限制。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 661
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 662
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 证据句在哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 663
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 主语/时间/数量完全一致吗？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 664
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 665
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 666
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 667
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 圈题干 → 回原文 → 找同义 → 对选项。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 668
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 670
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 题干给“according to paragraph 3”，第一步？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 671
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 原文“opens at 9:30; arrive 15 minutes early”，推荐到达？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 672
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 定位后优先读多大范围？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 673
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 看到选项原词就能选吗？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 674
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 细节题停止条件？",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 675
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 直接定位第3段。；2. 9:15；3. 通常前一句+本句+后一句。；4. 不能，仍要核对题目所问和全部条",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 676
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "件。；5. 明确证据与某选项同义，其他可排。",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 677
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 25,
      "sourceIndex": 678
    }
  ],
